WEBVTT

00:13:27.143 --> 00:13:30.315
and separation that comes
from heroic leadership,

00:13:30.339 --> 00:13:32.815
that I would be untouchable.

00:13:34.228 --> 00:13:35.561
This is an illusion.

00:13:36.776 --> 00:13:40.823
The joy and success that comes
from interdependence and vulnerability

00:13:40.847 --> 00:13:42.980
is worth the effort and the risk.

00:13:44.339 --> 00:13:48.116
And if we're going to solve the challenges
that the world is facing today,

00:13:48.140 --> 00:13:49.748
we have no alternative,

00:13:49.772 --> 00:13:52.572
so we had better start getting good at it.

00:13:53.532 --> 00:13:54.682
Thank you.

00:13:54.706 --> 00:13:59.595
(Applause)